{"id":"vod_md_3042","vodId":"3042","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"记录的地平线第一季","name_cn":"记录的地平线第一季","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"25集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230822-1/94d9090c571727fefde0f8cb5d9727f8.jpg"},"summary":"《幻境神话》是家喻户晓的网络游戏，在第十二次资料片更新之时，一场意外的发生竟然将三万名玩家困在了游戏构筑的虚拟世界之中。老牌玩家城惠（寺岛拓笃 配音）就是其中的一员，现实中个性内向的他在游戏里却极其富有领导才能，深受同伴的信赖和喜爱。恐惧和绝望笼罩在被困在游戏里的玩家的头顶上，个性开朗直爽大大咧咧的战士直继（前野智昭 配音）、拥有可爱外貌和强大实力的刺客晓（加藤英美里 配音）联同城惠站了出来，创立了工会“记录的地平线”，他们从大都市秋叶原开始出发，踏上冒险的旅途，决心开拓出属于他们的世界，找到脱出的方法。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-22 09:22:42","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/vHqbE22Q/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/CjMlVmPr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/VfKLJAb7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/QLSHQjfc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/3K9g3RLl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/lVeZZSlT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/aq7CPySs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/119c8kNW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/EyvXZ8hp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/oteDna2O/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/ZLLlxEzC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/P1BBeidP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/yxpkyNWe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/R3Kbo0d6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/XurWb8LM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://pl